/* Director Bear Chat question bank (both schools share one handbook and one set of steps).
   Every answer points a director to the Director Portal card or form that does the job, with the steps from that card.
   It never holds or shows a PIN, door code, password or anything about one child, family or staff member.
   To add a question: copy a line in QS, give it a new id, phrasings in q, extra match words in k, the answer in a,
   numbered steps in steps (optional), the card it opens in go, and more cards in also.
   school: 'Sanford' or 'DeLand 2' limits an answer to that school. {school} {office} {phone} are filled in for the director's school.
   live: 'openDate' answers closure questions from the 2026-27 calendar in bear-chat-data.js. */
